---
title: Document preparation with bounded retries
---
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Idle
  Idle --> Preparing: Start a document
  Preparing --> Checking: Working copy ready
  Checking --> Complete: Structure is valid
  Checking --> RetryWait: Source is temporarily unavailable
  RetryWait --> Preparing: Retry is permitted
  RetryWait --> Cancelled: Retry limit is reached
  Checking --> Rejected: Structure is invalid
  Rejected --> Preparing: Corrected source is supplied
  Complete --> [*]
  Cancelled --> [*]
